# Architecture and layering

Full detail: `docs/notepads/Architecture_and_Build.md` and `docs/notepads/Command_Bus_and_Module_Contracts.md`.

## Allowed dependencies (a module may depend only on modules listed for it)

| Module | May depend on |
|---|---|
| `core` | standard library, Eigen |
| `platform` | `core` |
| `doc` | `core` |
| `geom` | `core`, `doc` (OCCT allowed **only** here) |
| `sketch` | `core`, `doc`, `geom` |
| `part` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `sketch` |
| `asm` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `sketch`, `part` |
| `drw` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `part`, `asm` |
| `ecad/lib` | `core`, `doc` |
| `ecad/sch` | `core`, `doc`, `ecad/lib` |
| `ecad/pcb` | `core`, `doc`, `ecad/lib`, `ecad/sch` (Clipper2 allowed here) |
| `ecad/out` | `core`, `doc`, `ecad/lib`, `ecad/pcb`, `drw` |
| `link` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `sketch`, `part`, `asm`, `ecad/pcb` |
| `sim` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `asm`, `ecad/sch` (Chrono, ngspice only here) |
| `io` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `part`, `asm`, `ecad/pcb` |
| `render` | `core`, `doc`, `geom`, `platform` (graphics API here) |
| `cli` | every domain module; never `ui` |
| `ui` | everything (Qt Widgets only here) |
| `tests/<m>` | `<m>` and its dependencies, GoogleTest |

`scripts/check-layering.ps1` enforces this table on `.vcxproj` references and `#include` paths. Update the script and this table together, and only with an ADR.

## Patterns you must use

- **Command bus (A-03):** every data-changing action is an `app::core::Command` with a dotted name (`part.feature.extrude.create`), JSON parameters, `execute()` and `undo()`. Register commands in the module's `registerCommands()` function. UI code calls commands; it never mutates documents directly.
- **Stable IDs (A-04):** every persistent object has an `app::core::ObjectId` (UUID v7). Never use pointers or indices as persistent references.
- **Regeneration graph (A-07):** derived data is computed by nodes in the dependency graph. Never recompute eagerly in setters; mark dirty and let the graph regenerate.
- **Kernel adapter (A-05):** OCCT types never appear in headers outside `src/geom/`. Other modules use `app::geom` handles.
- **Persistent naming (A-06):** references to faces, edges and vertices go through `app::geom::TopoRef`, never raw kernel indices.
- **Headless first (A-02):** domain modules never include Qt Widgets and never block on UI.
- **Threads (A-10):** long work runs on `app::core::JobSystem` with progress and cancellation. The UI thread never waits more than 100 ms.
- **Factories (A-11):** feature types, importers, exporters and DRC checks register via factories; no central `switch` over types.
